{{Term/Store|Voltfin Trout|Voltfin Trouts|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Voltfin Trout}}
Voltfin Trouts can be found swimming in the [[Water (Terrain)|Waters]] of [[Hyrule Ridge]] and the [[Tabantha Frontier]]. Like other [[Fish]], they can also be dropped by [[Octorok]]s, specifically [[Forest Octorok]]s near [[Thundra Plateau]]. [[Link]] can eat one raw to restore one [[Heart]]. Voltfin Trouts exposed to [[Ice]] become [[Frozen Trout]], while ones exposed to [[Fire]] turn into [[Roasted Trout]]. [[Cooking]] with Voltfin Trouts result in [[Meal]]s that grant Link temporary [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

During the [[Side Quest]] "[[Riddles of Hyrule]]", [[Walton]] will ask Link to bring him several [[Item]]s that correspond to his riddles. The fourth riddle he tells asks for something with scales and a tail that will zap people, and refers to it as a shocking swimmer.<ref name="BotW Walton"/> When Link places a Voltfin Trout on the leaf, Walton will cheer that he figured it out, and then move on to the next riddle.<ref name="BotW Walton 2"/>

